[
  {
    "content_id": "10037001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;大流士王执政第二年六月一日，耶和华借着先知哈该对撒拉铁的儿子犹大省长所罗巴伯和约撒答的儿子大祭司约书亚说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;“万军之耶和华说，‘这些百姓说，重建耶和华殿的时候还没到。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因此，耶和华借先知哈该说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;“这殿还荒废时，你们却住在华丽的房子里吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说，你们要认真反省自己的行为。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们种多收少，吃不饱，喝不足，穿不暖，挣来的工钱却放在破漏口袋中。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说：“你们要认真反省自己的行为。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们要上山伐木，重建这殿，好让我欢喜并得到尊崇。这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你们盼望丰收，结果收的很少；你们把收成带回家，我却把它们吹走。这是什么缘故？万军之耶和华告诉你们，‘因为你们都忙于建自家的房子，任由我的殿荒废。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以，天不降露，地无出产。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我让旱灾临到大地、群山、五谷、葡萄、橄榄等地里的出产和人畜，以及你们所劳碌的一切。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;撒拉铁的儿子犹大省长所罗巴伯、约撒答的儿子大祭司约书亚和所有的余民，听到他们的上帝耶和华派先知哈该所讲的话，都顺服耶和华的话。百姓都敬畏耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶和华的使者哈该向百姓传达耶和华的话，说：“耶和华说，‘我与你们同在。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;耶和华感动撒拉铁的儿子犹大省长所罗巴伯、约撒答的儿子大祭司约书亚和所有的余民，他们就动工建造他们的上帝——万军之耶和华的殿，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;时值大流士王执政第二年六月二十四日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;七月二十一日，耶和华借先知哈该说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;“你去告诉撒拉铁的儿子犹大省长所罗巴伯、约撒答的儿子大祭司约书亚和所有的余民，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;‘你们幸存的人当中有谁见过这殿昔日的荣耀呢？现在你们看这殿如何？看上去岂不是无足轻重吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;所罗巴伯啊，你要刚强，这是耶和华说的。约撒答的儿子大祭司约书亚啊，你要刚强；这地方的所有百姓啊，你们要刚强。这是耶和华说的。你们要动工，因为我与你们同在。这是万军之耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;这是你们出埃及时我与你们立的约。不要惧怕，我的灵仍住在你们当中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;“‘万军之耶和华说，不久，我要再次震动天地、海洋和旱地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说，我要震动万国，万国的珍宝都要送到这殿，我要使这殿充满荣耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说，金子是我的，银子也是我的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说，这殿后来的荣耀必大过从前的荣耀。万军之耶和华说，我要在这地方赐下平安。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;大流士王执政第二年九月二十四日，耶和华对先知哈该说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;“万军之耶和华说，‘你去问祭司律法怎么说，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;如果有人用衣服兜着祭肉，而衣服碰到饼、汤、酒、油或其他食物，这些被衣服碰到的食物会成为圣洁之物吗？’”祭司们答道：“不会。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;哈该又说：“如果因碰过尸体而变得不洁净的人接触这些食物，这些食物会变得不洁净吗？”祭司答道：“会变得不洁净。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;于是哈该说：“耶和华说，‘这百姓和这国家在我面前也是如此。他们手中的各样工作和他们在那里所献的都不洁净。’</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;“‘你们现在要回想重建耶和华殿之前的光景。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;那时，有人盼望得到二十斗谷物，却只有十斗。有人盼望得到五十桶酒，榨酒池中却只有二十桶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我曾用虫灾、霉灾和冰雹毁灭你们的作物，你们仍没有归向我。这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;从今以后，也就是从九月二十四日起，你们要思想耶和华的殿奠基的日子，要认真思想。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;虽然粮仓里没有种子，葡萄树、无花果树、石榴树和橄榄树没结果子，但从今以后，我要赐福给你们。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;同一天，耶和华第二次对哈该说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;“你告诉犹大省长所罗巴伯，‘我必震动天地，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;推翻君王的宝座，消灭列国的势力，掀翻他们的战车和驾车的人，使战马跌倒、骑士自相残杀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10037002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "哈该书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "37002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;万军之耶和华说，我的仆人——撒拉铁的儿子所罗巴伯啊，到那日，我必使你作我盖印的戒指，因为我拣选了你。这是万军之耶和华说的。’”</p>"
  }
]